fadeAndStopSpeaking ramps activeServerAudio.volume down over ~150ms in 10 steps then pauses and clears activeServerAudio (server-TTS path); on the speechSynthesis path there is no native volume ramp so it calls synth.cancel() immediately -- that is the correct, honest behavior, not a bug.

